  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Wraithfeather was once a renowned musician in Subchain City, known for his electrifying guitar solos and high-energy stage dives. Now, with DRIP scarce and the music gone, he uses his stage experience to navigate the treacherous ruins as a courier, delivering vital messages and the occasional stolen growler of synthetic brew.",
    "class": "Courier",
    "name": "Wraithfeather",
    "personality": "Grizzled and aloof, Wraithfeather carries the weight of Subchain City's lost culture. He's a loner, preferring the company of his chucks to the endless squabbling of the flocks, but beneath his rough exterior lies a deep-seated loyalty to those few who earn his respect.",
